old #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Full model-pool support in the Models panel alias editor[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Model alias definitions overridden from the ACE Models panel can [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]specify round-robin pools and ordered fallback chains through a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]guided, keyboard-driven builder instead of hand-typed free text, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]the temporary-override path refuses selector expressions instead of[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]silently persisting a corrupted single target, and the docs [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]describe the shipped behavior.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]models_panel_pool_authoring.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/models_panel_pool_authoring.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-lz[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-lz/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Reject selector expressions in the temporary-override path[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]override-selector-reject[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]override-selector-reject: detect selector syntax with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]parse_model_alias_selector in the panel's Custom Override Model flow and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]refuse it with a message pointing at the persistent Edit key, instead of[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]letting a pool string split on its first slash and persist a bogus [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]single-target override.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Parse-based selector detection and prefilled custom input[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]selector-edit-plumbing[dim] · [dim][/dim]after override-selector-reject[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]selector-edit-plumbing: add a shared TUI selector helper module over the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]existing llm_provider API, replace the substring selector sniffing in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the alias Edit flow with real parsing plus per-member safety checks, and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]give the custom-model input an initial value so editing an existing [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]selector no longer means retyping it.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Guided pool and fallback builder modal[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]selector-builder[dim] · [dim][/dim]after selector-edit-plumbing[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]selector-builder: add a SelectorBuilderModal that assembles selector [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]members from the existing model picker and effort ladder with add, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]remove, reorder, per-member effort, and pool-versus-fallback toggling, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]gate member selection against nested selectors, and route a new picker [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]entry row through it into the unchanged preview and write path.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Documentation sync for selector authoring[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]selector-docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after selector-builder[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]selector-docs: correct the ACE Models panel documentation that claims [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the custom input only accepts concrete model strings, document the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]builder row and its keys, state that temporary overrides refuse [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]selectors, and cross-check the selector semantics and configuration [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]references.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-lz","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-lz.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-180ad13750dc39905324c1626762197e","started_at":"2026-08-14T14:51:01.563339+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1786725826,"sha":"4d5598eaf4fffd6ba3c4f5904e95f7dbec4a9749","subject":"docs(ace): correct selector authoring docs for Edit/Override and builder"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"716f1baff1e288daaa66641c23cc4be3b40c1e1c3aa8ec23819b97e9a359414b","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-lz.4/chat.md","size_bytes":4879},"commits":{"digest":"b537b0ed91f7601747618e1196e122fa9f213045b38e991caffae7e2d0ff3526","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-lz.4/commits.json","size_bytes":250},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-lz.4/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"fa9ef721a66607e45ff21801e47f03f846189437db229fbe0c763e4fdd306976","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-lz.4/meta.json","size_bytes":663},"prompt":{"digest":"132a15f8b8ceb46f2f407b34a8a3dfbc0d79ecb33e65897fde89653d9af9601a","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-lz.4/prompt.md","size_bytes":147},"state":{"digest":"45d9bf9d5248386ff32732e52e50639c2b0247ddbe85368b5e5087a5505692fe","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-lz.4/state.json","size_bytes":180}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-lz.4","local_name":"sase-lz.4","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-lz","agent_clan_generation":"20260814105047","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-lz.4","change